# forge.secrets — Model and token overrides for Forge
# Copy this file to forge.secrets and fill in your values.
# This file is gitignored. Values here override .env but not actual env vars.
#
# USAGE:
#   cp forge.secrets.example forge.secrets
#   # Then edit forge.secrets with your preferred models

# ── API credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required. Get your key at https://electronhub.ai
ELECTRONHUB_API_KEY=your_key_here
ELECTRONHUB_BASE_URL=https://api.electronhub.ai/v1

# ── Model overrides (SOTA defaults as of 2026-03-31) ─────────────────────────
# Change any tier to a different model from https://api.electronhub.ai/v1/models
# Uncomment the line to override the default.

# HEAVY tier — used for: architecture, multi-file refactors, hard debugging
# Default: claude-opus-4-6 ($5/$25 per MTok) — 80.8% SWE-bench
# FORGE_MODEL_HEAVY=claude-opus-4-6

# STANDARD tier — used for: most agent work, strategy, build, verify
# Default: claude-sonnet-4-6 ($3/$15 per MTok) — 79.6% SWE-bench
# FORGE_MODEL_STANDARD=claude-sonnet-4-6

# DESIGN tier — used for: UI/UX design, component specs, design critique
# Default: claude-sonnet-4-6 (vision-capable, high temperature)
# FORGE_MODEL_DESIGN=claude-sonnet-4-6

# WRITING tier — used for: README, pitch decks, demo scripts, copy
# Default: gpt-4.1 ($2/$8 per MTok) — strong instruction following
# FORGE_MODEL_WRITING=gpt-4.1

# BULK tier — used for: tests, lint fixes, boilerplate, seed data
# Default: gpt-4.1-mini ($0.40/$1.60 per MTok) — cost-efficient coding
# FORGE_MODEL_BULK=gpt-4.1-mini

# FAST tier — used for: hackathon scoring, browser actions, classification
# Default: gpt-5-nano ($0.05/$0.40 per MTok) — cheapest reasoning model
# FORGE_MODEL_FAST=gpt-5-nano

# VISION tier — used for: screenshot analysis, Lighthouse review, design audit
# Default: claude-sonnet-4-6 (native vision support)
# FORGE_MODEL_VISION=claude-sonnet-4-6

# ── Budget mode (cheaper alternatives) ───────────────────────────────────────
# To run Forge cheaply for testing, uncomment these overrides:
# FORGE_MODEL_HEAVY=claude-sonnet-4-6
# FORGE_MODEL_STANDARD=gpt-4.1
# FORGE_MODEL_DESIGN=gpt-4.1
# FORGE_MODEL_WRITING=gpt-4.1-mini

# ── Max output tokens per tier ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Defaults are already generous (16k-32k). Override only if you hit limits.
# FORGE_MAX_TOKENS_HEAVY=32000
# FORGE_MAX_TOKENS_STANDARD=16000
# FORGE_MAX_TOKENS_DESIGN=16000
# FORGE_MAX_TOKENS_WRITING=16000
# FORGE_MAX_TOKENS_BULK=8000
# FORGE_MAX_TOKENS_FAST=4000
# FORGE_MAX_TOKENS_VISION=16000

# ── Web search (optional upgrade) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# By default Forge uses ddgs (MIT, no key, free forever) for web research.
# Add a Brave Search API key for fresher results from Brave's own 30B-page index.
# Signup: https://api-dashboard.search.brave.com
# Free credit: ~$5/month (~1,000 queries). $5 per 1,000 thereafter.
# BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your_brave_api_key

# ── ForgeSearch — Agentic Search Engine ───────────────────────────────────────
# The search engine uses a 4-stage pipeline: query expansion → parallel retrieval
# → BM25+RRF hybrid fusion → cross-encoder reranking.
# All stages below are OPTIONAL — ddgs (free) works without any keys.

# Brave Search API — independent 30B-page index, best tech freshness.
# Free: ~1,000 queries/month. Then $5/1k. Sign up: https://api.search.brave.com/
# BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your_brave_key_here

# Exa — neural semantic search (best for judge/sponsor research).
# $7 per 1,000 requests with full content included (March 2026 pricing).
# Free credits on signup. https://exa.ai
# EXA_API_KEY=your_exa_key_here

# SearXNG — self-hosted metasearch (Docker). Fully free. 70+ engines.
# Start with: docker compose up searxng in forge/config/
# SEARXNG_URL=http://localhost:8080

# SearXNG secret key (auto-generated if not set, change for production)
# SEARXNG_SECRET_KEY=change-this-in-production

# Cross-encoder reranker (ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2) — free from HuggingFace.
# Downloads automatically on first deep_search() call (~30MB).
# Runs on RTX 4060 (your dedicated GPU). Set to "false" to disable.
# FORGE_SEARCH_RERANK=true

# ── Web dashboard (forge web) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Access token for the web dashboard (leave empty for no auth — local only)
# FORGE_WEB_TOKEN=your-secret-token-here
# Public URL of the dashboard (used in Discord notification links)
# FORGE_WEB_URL=https://sentinelhive.dev

# ── Feature flags (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Comma-separated flags, or individual FORGE_FLAG_<NAME>=1
# FORGE_FLAGS=SKIP_SECURITY_SCAN,FAST_BUILD_MODE
# FORGE_FLAG_SKIP_SECURITY_SCAN=1
